{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（15日）晚上10時許，警方接獲報案，指荃灣荃景圍208號荃德花園5座大廈全部停電，有人被困升降機。現場消息指，5座大廈大堂停電，升降機暫停運作，但單位仍有電力供應，住客如要上落要行樓梯。事故原因有待調查，現場消息指，懷疑涉及電錶房跳掣。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:24:51.178592+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T15:52:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T02:04:10.140286+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T16:17:51.615444+00:00","content_hash":"1ae296f19553d30682d5a8b9ddb3030074e0aa887a4793c443540dbb8382a819","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}